; village_empty_house.room - A Casa Vazia, Combinado 4 (design 02 section 8.4), the trial empty_house folded onto two floors.
; The gate (col 4, upper floor) holds only while both plates (cols 1 and 12, lower floor) do: Solstice and Sombra on col 1, Soltar on the load, then the long way round.
; The reward alcove (cols 1-3, upper floor) is left empty.

; Indoors: wood planks, so no earth turf lip shows; no interior grows grass (systems/grass).

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = village

